# Issue #3134 (greenfield flag day): a detach carries the document version
# its client read the slot removed at, so an older client without
# `documentVersionVector` is refused with 400. Remove this exact diagnostic as
# soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /blobs/{blobId}/attachment-bindings/{bindingId}/detach added the new required request property `documentVersionVector`

# Issue #3134: a detach's 409 may name `attachment_document_changed`, so its
# failure code is an enum of two values instead of one constant.
# Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /blobs/{blobId}/attachment-bindings/{bindingId}/detach the `code` response property const value `container_unavailable` was removed for the status `409`

# Issue #3134: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /blobs/{blobId}/attachment-bindings/{bindingId}/detach added the new `attachment_document_changed` enum value to the `code` response property for the response status `409`

